# 基础词 Unit 03 短语

## 常考短语

- **give approval to**: 批准 — The board gave approval to the new budget. 董事会批准了新预算。
- **problems arise from**: 问题源于 — Many problems arise from poor planning. 许多问题源于计划不周。
- **arrange for**: 安排 — She arranged for a taxi to pick him up. 她安排了一辆出租车接他。
- **under arrest**: 被逮捕 — The suspect was placed under arrest. 嫌疑人被逮捕了。
- **aside from**: 除…之外 — Aside from the cost, there are other considerations. 除成本外，还有其他考虑因素。
- **every aspect of**: …的方方面面 — We must consider every aspect of the issue. 我们必须考虑问题的方方面面。
- **assemble in**: 在…集合 — The troops assembled in the square. 部队在广场集合。
- **a valuable asset**: 宝贵的财富 — Experience is a valuable asset in the workplace. 经验是职场中的宝贵财富。
- **assist sb in doing sth**: 帮助某人做某事 — The software assists users in managing data. 该软件帮助用户管理数据。
- **be associated with**: 与…有关 — The disease is associated with poor nutrition. 这种疾病与营养不良有关。
- **atmosphere of**: …的气氛 — The meeting had an atmosphere of tension. 会议气氛紧张。
- **attach importance to**: 重视 — The school attaches great importance to discipline. 学校非常重视纪律。
- **attempt to do sth**: 试图做某事 — He attempted to escape from prison. 他试图越狱。
- **attend a meeting**: 参加会议 — All staff must attend the meeting. 所有员工必须参加会议。
- **avoid doing sth**: 避免做某事 — You should avoid making the same mistake. 你应该避免犯同样的错误。
